sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant C as Clerk
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant J as Clerk signing keys
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    U->>F: Open a portal page
    F->>C: Sign in if there is no session
    C-->>F: Session
    F->>A: Request with Bearer token and X-Workspace-ID
    A->>J: Fetch signing key for the token (cached)
    A->>A: Verify signature, issuer, expiry, issued-at, subject
    alt token missing, invalid or expired
        A-->>F: 401
    else authentication not configured
        A-->>F: 503
    else workspace header missing
        A-->>F: 400
    else
        A->>D: Look up membership for this user and workspace
        alt member
            D-->>A: Membership found
            A->>D: Workspace-scoped query
            A-->>F: 200 or 201
        else workspace exists, user is not a member
            A-->>F: 403
        else workspace does not exist
            A-->>F: 404
        end
    end
